    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to live out the American dream of having an abysmal 9-5 with rude management and 0 upward mobility? no?\u00a0 well too bad, i made a game about it anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a down-on-your-luck college student, who just scored a gig to help pay for ramen (or whatever cheap dorm food that strikes your fancy). You are now a proud employee of Sell-By Grocers! Welcome to the team. Well... I say &quot;team&quot;, but in reality, its just you, and your manager, Biff. Stay safe out there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a fully first person game, where you stock shelves, deal with customers, and do your best to keep the anger meter down. multiplayer co-op coming soon.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to live out the American dream of having an abysmal 9-5 with rude management and 0 upward mobility? no?\u00a0 well too bad, i made a game about it anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a down-on-your-luck college student, who just scored a gig to help pay for ramen (or whatever cheap dorm food that strikes your fancy). You are now a proud employee of Sell-By Grocers! Welcome to the team. Well... I say &quot;team&quot;, but in reality, its just you, and your manager, Biff. Stay safe out there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a fully first person game, where you stock shelves, deal with customers, and do your best to keep the anger meter down. multiplayer co-op coming soon.</p>",
